{"title":"25","section":"642","heading":"Omitted","lead":"","tree":[],"notes":[{"topic":"editorialNotes","text":"Editorial Notes"},{"topic":"codification","text":"Codification Section, Pub. L. 91–264, § 2, May 22, 1970, 84 Stat. 260, which related to powers of the Hopi Tribal Council, was omitted from the Code as being of special and not general application."}],"sourceCredit":"","releasePoint":"119-102","ancestors":[{"type":"title","num":"Title 25—","heading":"INDIANS","identifier":"/us/usc/t25"},{"type":"chapter","num":"CHAPTER 14—","heading":"MISCELLANEOUS","identifier":"/us/usc/t25/ch14"},{"type":"subchapter","num":"SUBCHAPTER XXIII—","heading":"HOPI TRIBE: INDUSTRIAL PARK","identifier":"/us/usc/t25/ch14/schXXIII"}]}